{"info": {"address1": "GR House", "address2": "Hiran Magri Sector-11", "city": "Udaipur", "zip": "313002", "country": "India", "phone": "91 29 4248 7370", "website": "https://www.grinfra.com", "industry": "Engineering & Construction", "industryKey": "engineering-construction", "industryDisp": "Engineering & Construction", "sector": "Industrials", "sectorKey": "industrials", "sectorDisp": "Industrials", "longBusinessSummary": "G R Infraprojects Limited provides civil construction services in India. It operates through the Engineering, Procurement, and Construction; Built, Operate and Transfer/Annuity Projects; and Others segments. It offers engineering, procurement, construction (EPC), and project management services for roads and highways, bridges, airport runway, railways and metro, hydro and tunneling, power transmission and distribution, ropeways, logistics infrastructure, telecom and IT infrastructures. The company also constructs and develops state and national highways, bridges, culverts, flyovers, airport runways, tunnels, and rail over bridges. It also offers a range of services on a turnkey basis in railway infrastructure projects, such as civil infrastructures, including earthworks, bridges, station buildings, and facilities; new track laying and rehabilitation of existing tracks; railway electrification and power systems; and signaling and telecommunication services. In addition, the company constructs tunnels in hydropower, railways, metro rail, roads, and highways; designs, constructs, and maintains transmission lines, substations, and distribution networks; and provides multimodal logistics solutions comprising road and rail to support cargo movement and bolster. Further, it manufactures bitumen emulsion, construction chemicals, metal crash barrier, OHE MAST, road signage board, and thermoplastic paint.; and undertakes repair and maintenance of EPC and HAM projects. The company was formerly known as G.R. Agarwal Builders and Developers Limited and changed its name to G R Infraprojects Limited in August 2007. G R Infraprojects Limited was incorporated in 1995 and is headquartered in Udaipur, India.", "companyOfficers": [{"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Ajendra Kumar Agarwal", "age": 61, "title": "MD & Whole Time Director", "yearBorn": 1964, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 81700000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Anand  Rathi", "age": 50, "title": "Chief Financial Officer", "yearBorn": 1975, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Sudhir  Mutha", "title": "Company Secretary & Compliance Officer", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Devki Nandan Agarwal", "age": 69, "title": "President of Plant & Equipments", "yearBorn": 1956, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Mahendra Kumar Agarwal", "age": 63, "title": "President of Procurement", "yearBorn": 1962, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Ajai Kumar Singh Chauhan", "age": 65, "title": "President & Head of Contracts Management", "yearBorn": 1960, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Vikas  Agarwal", "age": 45, "title": "Whole Time Director", "yearBorn": 1980, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 36000000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Vinod Kumar Chauhan", "age": 56, "title": "Senior Vice President of Operation", "yearBorn": 1969, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Bharat Bhushan Aggarwal", "age": 57, "title": "Senior Vice President of HR & Admin", "yearBorn": 1968, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Hemant Kumar Garg", "age": 56, "title": "Senior Vice President of Design", "yearBorn": 1969, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exer